<title>UK: Dresdner Bank adds 1.5 bln FRF to Nov 2008 bond.</title>
<headline>Dresdner Bank adds 1.5 bln FRF to Nov 2008 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following fungible bond was announced by joint lead managers Banque Nationale de Paris and Dresdner Kleinwort Benson.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DRESDNER FINANCE BV</p>
<p>GUARANTOR  DRESDNER BANK AG</p>
<p> AMT   *1.5 BLN FRF   COUPON     6.25	MATURITY    05.NOV.08</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  104.306   PAY DATE    28.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.00	REOFFER    102.656   SPREAD	+18 BP</p>
<p> NOTES     *BRINGS TOTAL SIZE TO 4.0 BLN FRF.</p>
<p>		PAYMENT PLUS 113 DAYS ACCRUED INTEREST.</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    PARIS/LUX PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA+	 DENOMS (K) 10-100-1M SALE LIMITS **</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    HOME CTRY  GERMANY   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.35	SELL CONC  1.65	PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND OAT DUE OCTOBER 2008.</p>
<p> NOTES    **US/UK/FR/NL/DE</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
